## Flowchart: Combined BST Validation

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[/Read level-order input/]
    B --> C[Construct binary tree]
    C --> D[Initialize minimum and maximum bounds]
    D --> E[Validate root node]

    E --> F{Is current node NULL?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Return Valid]
    F -- No --> H{Does node violate its bounds?}

    H -- Yes --> I[Record first violating node]
    I --> J[Return Invalid]

    H -- No --> K[Validate left subtree]
    K --> L{Is left subtree valid?}

    L -- No --> J
    L -- Yes --> M[Validate right subtree]

    M --> N{Is right subtree valid?}
    N -- No --> J
    N -- Yes --> G

    G --> O[Display: Valid BST]
    J --> P[Display: Invalid BST and violating node]

    O --> Q([Stop])
    P --> Q
```
